title: Targeting our Enemies
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: paramilitaries
view-if: targeting_enemies_timer <= 0
card-image: img/blutmai_2.jpg
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; targeting_enemies_timer +=6
frequency: 100

= Targeting our Enemies

The Weimar republic has always had a problem with paramilitary violence. We often come into conflict with the Nazi SA, Stahlhelm, and occasionally the Reichsbanner. We must protect our supporters and our rallies but sometimes a more "proactive* approach can help.

- @attack_stahlhelm: Attack the Stahlhelm
- @attack_sa: Attack the SA
- @attack_reichsbanner: Attack the Reichsbanner
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action


@attack_stahlhelm
on-arrival: rfb_success = rfb_strength*rfb_militancy - sh_strength*sh_militancy; strife += 1
go-to: rfb_sh_win if rfb_success >= 0; rfb_sh_lose if rfb_success < 0

@rfb_sh_win
on-arrival: {!

if (Q.rfb_strength < Q.sh_strength) {

    Q.rfb_strength *= 0.97
    Q.rfb_militancy *= 0.97

    Q.sh_militancy *= 0.95
    Q.sh_strength *= 0.95
}

if (Q.rfb_strength >= Q.sh_strength) {

    Q.rfb_strength *= 1.05
    Q.rfb_militancy *= 0.98

    Q.sh_strength *= 0.93
    Q.sh_militancy *= 0.95
}
}

We have won against the Stahlhelm and our forces remain strong. [? if rfb_strength < sh_strength: Our RFB's victory against the larger Stahlhelm has invigorated support for us. ?]

@rfb_sh_lose
on-arrival: rfb_strength *= 0.95; rfb_militancy *= 0.95; sh_strength *= 0.97; sh_militancy *= 0.96

We have lost against the Stahlhelm and the RFB suffers as a result.

@attack_sa
on-arrival: rfb_success = rfb_strength*rfb_militancy - sa_strength*sa_militancy; strife += 1
go-to: rfb_sa_win if rfb_success >= 0; rfb_sa_lose if rfb_success < 0

@rfb_sa_win
on-arrival: rfb_strength *= 0.98; rfb_militancy *= 0.97; sa_strength *= 0.95; sa_militancy *= 0.96

We have won against the SA and our forces remain strong.

@rfb_sa_lose
on-arrival: rfb_strength *= 0.95; rfb_militancy *= 0.95; sa_strength *= 0.97; sa_militancy *= 0.96

We have lost against the SA and the RFB suffers as a result.

@attack_reichsbanner
on-arrival: rfb_success = rfb_strength*rfb_militancy; sa_strength*sa_militancy; strife += 1
go-to: rfb_rb_win if rfb_success >= 0; rfb_rb_lose if rfb_success < 0
choose-if: kpd_truce ==0
unavailable_subtitle: We have already made a truce with the Reichsbanner.

@rfb_rb_win
on-arrival: {!

if (Q.rb_militancy >= 0.5) {

    Q.rfb_strength *= 0.97
    Q.rfb_militancy *= 0.97

    Q.rb_strength *= 0.97
    Q.rb_militancy *= 0.96
}

if (Q.rb_militancy < 0.5) {

    Q.rfb_strength *= 0.97
    Q.rfb_militancy *= 0.98

    Q.rb_strength *= 0.94
    Q.rb_militancy *= 1.15
}
}

We have won against the Reichsbanner and our forces remain strong. [? if rb_militancy <= 0.5: Unfortunately, they have began militarizing as a result. ?]

@rfb_rb_lose
on-arrival: rfb_strength *= 0.95; rfb_militancy *= 0.95; rb_strength *= 0.97; rb_militancy *= 0.96

We have lost against the Reichsbanner and the RFB suffers as a result. [? if rb_militancy >= 0.5: It is extra humiliating that we also lost to the least militarized paramilitary. ?]